{"key":"1fadcfddb99a562a","source_file":"Potts Ma - Me.json","source_id":34662,"source_url":"concordance-mate-ppl-compar","term":"Mate","headwords":["Mate"],"latin":["Compar"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Mate"],"latin":["Compar"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","CL","DP"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"2025","subsection":"4"},"text":"Like, but not equal. AC 2093:4.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DP","section":"74","subsection":"2"},"text":"Every affection has its own mate as consort... For an affection without its mate as consort is not anything...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DP","section":"96","subsection":"3"},"text":"To understand, is its consort or mate...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"DP","section":"96","subsection":"4"},"text":"Desire, with its mate knowledge. DP 161.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"216","subsection":null},"text":"They are then consociated with mates of similitude.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"229","subsection":"2"},"text":"They know as from instinct that they are mates.","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"mate","url":"/meta/potts/mate/"}